/* Abra Travels demos: the 8 launch languages and the translations for the five that are not Telugu or Hindi.
   Telugu and Hindi live in each app's own dictionary; this file adds Kannada, Tamil, Malayalam, Marathi and Bengali.
   A phrase with no translation shows in English. The wording has NOT been reviewed by native speakers yet. */
